# The local H2 database: wherever the application was started from, it makes a folder named h2
# there. It holds accounts and password hashes, so it is never committed. (2.3 listed only the
# two folders inside the backends; a database made by starting from the top folder slipped through.)
h2/
*.mv.db
*.trace.db

